<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">For the six months ended December 31, 2024, and
2023, the Company recognized $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProvisionForOtherCreditLosses" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-5927">365,000</ix:nonFraction>, and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c9" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProvisionForOtherCreditLosses" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-5928">0</ix:nonFraction> of allowance on credit losses, respectively.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

