</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><ix:continuation continuedAt="_StockholdersEquityNoteDisclosureTextBlock-c0_cont_3" id="_StockholdersEquityNoteDisclosureTextBlock-c0_cont_2"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" escape="true" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfNonvestedRestrictedStockUnitsActivityTableTextBlock" id="ixv-4793"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Following is a summary of the restricted stock grants:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

